      "start_seconds": 201.13,
      "end_seconds": 213.62,
      "duration_seconds": 12.49,
      "text": "okay, so the vitals from earlier pulse is 75 beats a minute, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, weight 71 kilos, pressure 116 over 82, height 162 centimetres, temp 36.8 degrees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
