      "start_seconds": 272.79,
      "end_seconds": 290.48,
      "duration_seconds": 17.69,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? I think we're dealing with a depressive episode at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. Today I'm not changing anything. That's it on my side. Anything unclear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
